<div class="alert alert-danger d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 py-2" id="qb-reconnect-banner" role="alert">
    <span>
        <strong>QuickBooks needs to be reconnected.</strong>
        It stopped accepting LabelShop's saved sign-in, so nothing can be sent to QuickBooks until someone connects again.
    </span>
    <a asp-page="/Settings/QuickBooks" asp-fragment="qb-connection" class="btn btn-sm btn-danger ms-auto">Open QuickBooks setup</a>
</div>
